  "mach:judgement": "Caution",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The Mahmood Lab standard for large-scale WSI feature extraction with 22+ encoder integrations, multi-GPU support, v0.3.0 May 2026, backwards-compatible with CLAM. Practically the successor preprocessing pipeline for CLAM-based workflows. However, CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0 is highly restrictive: non-commercial and no-derivatives clauses mean commercial use requires prior written approval from Harvard. Unsuitable as a dependency in any commercial or production healthcare deployment without a separate licence agreement.",
